sequenceDiagram
  actor Worker
  participant UI as GigPulse UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Data as Data / Feature Store
  participant Model as Model Registry + Predictors
  participant Rank as Recommendation Engine
  Worker->>UI: Select time window, zones and preferences
  UI->>API: POST /recommendations/preview
  API->>API: Validate auth, ownership, limits and constraints
  API->>Data: Fetch permitted history and point-in-time features
  Data-->>API: Features + source quality + coverage
  API->>Model: Predict earnings and selected demand target
  Model-->>API: Estimates, intervals, versions and limitations
  API->>Rank: Score eligible candidates under preferences
  Rank-->>API: Ranked options + component scores + exclusions
  API-->>UI: Recommendations with evidence and caveats
  UI-->>Worker: Compare / save / ignore options
  Note over Worker,Rank: No automatic platform action or order acceptance occurs
